  "notes": "Current Liebherr datasheet, downloaded from liebherr.com: the crane is now rated 800 t max (originally 750 t). The 800 t value holds only over the rear ±10° at 3 m, 16.3 m boom; that over-rear column was left out, and the 360° maximum is 268.9 t. Main telescopic boom T table, no Y-guying. The table icon shows no outrigger dimension; 12 x 12 m is the maximum support base (p.5 drawing: 11998 x 11999 mm; p.19 VarioBase '12m x 12m'). operatingWeight_t = 108 t is the road weight (9 x 12 t) with the full telescopic boom (p.9-10). maxOutriggerForce 213 t (2093 kN, p.8). Max hook height for the T boom is not stated numerically; the cover's 152 m figure is with lattice jib. Hook block weight is part of the load and must be deducted (remark 5, p.121). Charts are per EN 13000 with a minimum wind speed of 9 m/s. The 20 m row reads 106.6 t (21.8 m) vs 112.1 t (27.2 m), exactly as printed."
